#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset.rst:2
msgid "chemotools.adaptation.functions.add\\_offset"
msgstr "chemotools.adaptation.functions.add\\_offset"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:1 of
msgid "Add a baseline offset to every row of ``X``."
msgstr "为 ``X`` 的每一行添加基线偏移量。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:3 of
msgid ""
"Useful for correcting instrument drift, dark-current baselines, or "
"additive scatter effects that have been measured externally."
msgstr ""
"适用于校正仪器漂移、暗电流基线或通过外部测量得到的加性散射效应。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset of
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:6 of
msgid "Input spectra."
msgstr "输入光谱。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:8 of
msgid ""
"Offset to add.  Accepted shapes:  * scalar ``float`` — added to every "
"element. * ``(n_samples, 1)`` — per-sample scalar offset. * ``(1, "
"n_features)`` — per-feature offset shared across samples. * ``(n_samples,"
" n_features)`` — per-sample full spectrum.  1-D inputs are rejected; use "
"``.reshape(-1, 1)`` for per-sample or ``.reshape(1, -1)`` for per-"
"feature."
msgstr ""
"要添加的偏移量。接受以下形状： * 标量 ``float`` — 添加到每个元素。 * "
"``(n_samples, 1)`` — 逐样本标量偏移量。 * ``(1, n_features)`` — "
"样本间共享的逐特征偏移量。 * ``(n_samples, n_features)`` — 逐样本完整光谱。 "
"不接受一维输入；逐样本偏移量请使用 ``.reshape(-1, 1)``，逐特征偏移量请使用 "
"``.reshape(1, -1)``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:8 of
msgid "Offset to add.  Accepted shapes:"
msgstr "要添加的偏移量。接受以下形状："

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:10 of
msgid "scalar ``float`` — added to every element."
msgstr "标量 ``float`` — 添加到每个元素。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:11 of
msgid "``(n_samples, 1)`` — per-sample scalar offset."
msgstr "``(n_samples, 1)`` — 逐样本标量偏移量。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:12 of
msgid "``(1, n_features)`` — per-feature offset shared across samples."
msgstr "``(1, n_features)`` — 样本间共享的逐特征偏移量。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:13 of
msgid "``(n_samples, n_features)`` — per-sample full spectrum."
msgstr "``(n_samples, n_features)`` — 逐样本完整光谱。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:15 of
msgid ""
"1-D inputs are rejected; use ``.reshape(-1, 1)`` for per-sample or "
"``.reshape(1, -1)`` for per-feature."
msgstr ""
"不接受一维输入；逐样本偏移量请使用 ``.reshape(-1, 1)``，逐特征偏移量请使用 "
"``.reshape(1, -1)``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset of
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:19 of
msgid "**X_shifted** -- ``X + offset``."
msgstr "**X_shifted** -- ``X + offset``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset of
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: chemotools.adaptation.functions.add_offset:23 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

